## Output Files

Each run produces three files, named `<mode>_<type>_<timestamp>.txt|md`:

| File | Contents | Audience |
|------|----------|----------|
| `<mode>_report_<ts>.txt` | All raw Db2 output | DBA reference, deeper drill-down |
| `<mode>_prompt_<ts>.md` | Structured LLM prompt — paste directly | GitHub Copilot |
| `<mode>_verify_<ts>.txt` | Four-expert checklist + LLM recommendation | Operator before submitting |

